---
Add track sound selector dropdown.

Each track should have a dropdown to select its sample (for sampler tracks)
or synth preset (for synth tracks).

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Sampler tracks show dropdown listing available samples
- [ ] Synth tracks show dropdown listing available presets
- [ ] Selecting an item loads the sample/preset for that track
- [ ] Current selection displayed when dropdown is closed
- [ ] Dropdown closes on selection or click outside

## Test Plan
- [ ] Click dropdown on sampler track, verify sample list shown
- [ ] Select a sample, verify it loads and plays correctly
- [ ] Click dropdown on synth track, verify preset list shown
- [ ] Select a preset, verify synth parameters update
